Package: attractor
Title: Create and Plot Strange Attractors
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Date: 2019-05-13
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Andrie", family = "de Vries",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "apdevries@gmail.com"),
    person(given = "Antonio", family = "Sánchez",
           role = c("ctb"),
           email = "aschinchon@gmail.com"))
Description: Create and plot attractors, specifically an attractor described by 
    Julian Sprott in his book ""Strange Attractors: Creating Patterns in Chaos".  
    The package is fast, because the attractor algorithm uses 'Rcpp' for speed. 
    In addition, the resulting attractor is discretized (binned) into a much 
    smaller matrix, making plotting also very fast.
